I am making my first dinner in the apartment.
The pot stands on the stove.
There are vegetables lying on the table.
But the stove is a problem.
It lights up, but the pot is cold.
There is no heat.
I walk out into the hallway.
Nina lives right next door.
I knock on her door.
She opens.
"Can you help me a little?" I ask.
Nina comes into my apartment with me.
She looks at the stove and laughs.
"You just press here," she says.
Now there is heat under the pot.
"It works!" I say.
"Will you stay and eat with me?" I ask.
